udp_prague
===========

This distribution contains two separately identified upstream contributions:

1. The UDP Prague controller, packet formats, socket/runtime code, and the
   demo application are adapted from L4STeam/udp_prague and are distributed
   under Apache-2.0. The upstream project and license are available at
   https://github.com/L4STeam/udp_prague.

2. `src/congestion/classic_aqm.rs` is an adaptation of the Linux TCP-Prague
   Classic-ECN/AQM detector and fallback equations. The corresponding Linux
   implementations are GPL-2.0-only. This file is therefore identified as
   GPL-2.0-only and the full license text is included at
   `LICENSES/GPL-2.0-only.txt`.

   The referenced kernel implementation carries Nokia copyright and the
   following authors: Chia-Yu Chang, Olivier Tilmans, Koen De Schepper, and
   Bob Briscoe. Their original GPL notice remains applicable to the adapted
   detector.

   Source references:
   - L4STeam/linux, `testing`, `net/ipv4/tcp_prague.c`:
     https://github.com/L4STeam/linux/blob/testing/net/ipv4/tcp_prague.c
   - minuscat/l4steam-6.18.y, `testing-net-next39`,
     `net/ipv4/tcp_prague.c`:
     https://github.com/minuscat/l4steam-6.18.y/blob/testing-net-next39/net/ipv4/tcp_prague.c
   - RFC 9331, Appendix A:
     https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9331.html

The package-level Cargo license expression is `Apache-2.0 AND GPL-2.0-only`.
The GPL-covered monitor and code that incorporates it must retain the GPL
terms; the Apache-covered portions retain the Apache-2.0 terms.
